&oh=00_Af0SbuU2Zo10pE1v0OLHklPNVAG4KV7ZYY85m12TucKFBQ&oe=69EF7515"}, {"file_name": "Interview_01.png", "id": "558098475502894", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982460_558098478836227_2195642163881727498_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OFxLsiymBBgQ7kNvwGkucEY&_nc_oc=AdoV8O8t1BIvzHweGuGK6aPE0uIwbmcWoQK88ENdJRg9YBOi8SrKgXMRt1AxNLu3Rzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3ZoxxLSicTONFxZPoVF9VmxjxKezIR2UCKKMidy1P42w&oe=69EF594E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JOb INterview Simulator (4).png", "id": "371985591479423", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035469_371985598146089_1320847157226308449_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OJ8RDqLI51MQ7kNvwGoSh-O&_nc_oc=AdpZgTWMX6-MWOE5Gt_JFj6ZmP9vQVCx_Lv6Ysu8gaxSsESO4-tGeS7SIMbyhnKcb40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1xbyN_k_ad_81t1Eg-yB2BQxgqAeSuAWXSHbS7-zj36A&oe=69EF58D0"}, "display_name": "Job Interview Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Proficient job interviewing craft is vital to attain the careers of our dreams. Unfortunately, it's difficult to practice this skill in a realistic way.\n\nThat's why we built the Job Interview Simulator. Simulate the entire interviewing process; from emailing HR before the interview, picking an outfit, arriving on time, catching the elevator, greeting the receptionist, and acing the interview. \n\nFeel the situational pressure of a Job Interview in an immersive virtual environent, and refine your interviewing craft with automated feedback. \n", "short_description": "Simulate the experience of a Job Interview in Virtual Reality. Practice and hone your interviewing craft in a safe setting, so you can ace your next job interview!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.workwindow.com.au/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.workwindow.co